      "value": "<p><em>“The mirror shows you what you could become. Then it offers to help.”</em></p><p><strong>Chaos Origin:</strong> Qliphothic Mirror</p><p>You channel the shadow-side of the fracture: entropy with a personality, dreamstuff that learned to bite.</p><p>Qliphothic Mirrors specialize in reflection harm, damage exchange, high-risk power bargains, and a late-game ability to force failed outcomes at personal cost.</p><p><strong>Table Safety:</strong> This subclass is about consequence, not cruelty. Keep it dramatic and consensual.</p>",
